.GOLF.BIG12.ES.078.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – No. 12-seeded West Virginia defeated No. 5 TCU, 4-1, and tied No. 4 Kansas, 2.5-2.5, on day one of the Big 12 Match Play at The Country Club in Salt Lake City, Utah, on Monday.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/10122026.GOLF.BIG12.ES.078.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/10122026.GOLF.BIG12.ES.078.jpg"><media:title>Ryan Leach hits a shot in Big 12 Match Play</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/10122026.GOLF.BIG12.ES.078.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:44:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>5</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59531</s:story_id></item><item><title>West Virginia and American End in Scoreless Draw</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/12/mens-soccer-west-virginia-and-american-end-in-scoreless-draw</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/12/mens-soccer-west-virginia-and-american-end-in-scoreless-draw</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Julen Recalde" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/12/WVU08254.jpg" /><br /><br />WASHINGTON – The No. 15 West Virginia University men's soccer team played to a 0-0 draw with American, Monday afternoon at Reeves Field. The Mountaineers go to 5-2-4 while the Eagles go to 2-6-4.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/WVU08254.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/WVU08254.jpg"><media:title>Julen Recalde</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/WVU08254.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:17:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59530</s:story_id></item><item><title>WVU Downs TCU to Start Big 12 Match Play Championship</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/12/golf-wvu-downs-tcu-to-start-big-12-match-play-championship</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/12/golf-wvu-downs-tcu-to-start-big-12-match-play-championship</guid><category>Golf</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="A chip shot of Jack Michael in the Big 12 Match Play Championship" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/12/10122026.GOLF.BIG12.ES.129.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – No. 12-seeded West Virginia went undefeated against No. 5-seeded TCU to win the first match of the Big 12 Match Play Championship, 4-1, at The Country Club in Salt Lake City, Utah, on Monday.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/10122026.GOLF.BIG12.ES.129.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/10122026.GOLF.BIG12.ES.129.jpg"><media:title>A chip shot of Jack Michael in the Big 12 Match Play Championship</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/10122026.GOLF.BIG12.ES.129.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:42:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>5</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59529</s:story_id></item><item><title>Women’s Basketball to Host Track or Treat</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/20