16.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia Cross Country team has been named the WVU Student-Athletes of the Week, presented by University Apartments.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/wvu.nutty26-16.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/wvu.nutty26-16.jpg"><media:title>WVU Cross Country Team poses following the win at the Nuttycombe Invitational</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/wvu.nutty26-16.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:26:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>10</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59527</s:story_id></item><item><title>TCU Game to be Televised at Noon on ESPN2</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/12/football-tcu-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-on-espn2</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/12/football-tcu-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-on-espn2</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="TCUGameTime-26" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/12/W8-GameTimeAnnouncement-16x9.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that WVU's Oct. 24 Big 12 Conference football game at TCU will be televised at noon, ET, on ESPN2.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/W8-GameTimeAnnouncement-16x9.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/12/W8-GameTimeAnnouncement-16x9.jpg"><media:title>TCUGameTime-26</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="